00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:53.620
around a single product cycle catalyst while maintaining a hard stop. While we wait on NVDA,

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:59.620
here's how yesterday's flash trade performed. Yesterday's flash trade was SNON

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:11.240
